    "",
    "This file is asserted three ways by test/contract: against the engine's",
    "own dispatch table (parsed from the processor, so the manifest cannot",
    "claim an operation the engine does not route), against the protocol",
    "README (so no operation ships undocumented), and against each SDK's",
    "source (so a gap cannot be closed or opened without saying so here).",
    "",
    "Every SDK can reach every operation through its generic request escape",
    "hatch. A gap means no typed method, not no access."
